+   read and before the taxi moves) and modFrame instead of hudDraw (at the end, after the scene).
+
+   Y: your driver steps out beside the cab door: the cab driver is hidden, the taxi stays put and
+   the camera follows the one outside. The stick points where they go on screen (R: run, A: jump).
+   Y again, standing at the driver's door (the cab's left side): back in. Y beside a traffic car:
+   take it over; X: hail a taxi (traffic.c).
+
+   Globals must be initialised: the blob has no zeroed (B) section. */
