+
+/* Before the executors (modTraffic): on foot, no boarding, and set objects and passers-by around
+   him. The crowd reads its car from CROWD_CAR: the car itself, or on foot one where he stands,
+   moving the way he walks (its direction picks where people spawn: ahead). */
